- {"name": "container_cpu_cfs_periods_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of elapsed enforcement period intervals."}
Question: Use the data from the past hour to predict the CPU usage (accounting for limit) trend of the pods of the downstream services of ts-inside-payment-service in the next 2 hours, and find the pods whose CPU usage will exceed 80% in the future.
